    "description": "If you're a passionate Reservation Manager with drive and ambition, SOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates in Noida is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout SOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates:\nSOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with travel agents and OTAs for occupancy optimization\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n• Develop and maintain relationships with corporate clients\n• Train and supervise front-line staff on service standards\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Sc / M.Sc in Life Sciences\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Barista Skills\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in PMS Systems\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in F&B Service\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n• Proficiency in Yield Management\n• Proficiency in GDS Systems\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with SOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates!",
